2 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"故你应当为你的主而礼拜，并宰牺牲。\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"首页\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"章 Al-Kawthar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/surah/108.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"节 2\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/108-2.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> › <a href=\"/zh/surah/108.html\">章 Al-Kawthar</a> › 节 2</nav><h1>经注： 章 Al-Kawthar 108:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَانْحَرْ﴾</p><section><h3>意义翻译</h3><p class=\"tr\">故你应当为你的主而礼拜，并宰牺牲。</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Chinese Translation - Muhammad Makeen — v1.0.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">两位伊玛目的话以阿拉伯语原文逐字呈现，并附出处。</p><section><h2>伊斯兰谢赫 伊本·泰米叶</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أمره الله أن يجمع بين هاتين العبادتين العظيمتين وهما الصلاة والنسك الدالتان على القرب والتواضع والافتقار وحسن الظن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/531</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>伊玛目 伊本·盖伊姆</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا يقرن الله سبحانه بينهما كقوله: {فصل لربك وانحر}<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 2/118</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وبدأ في العيد بالصلاة ثم جعل النحر بعدها، وأخبر أن ( «من ذبح قبلها، فلا نسك له» ) تقديما لما بدأ الله به في قوله {فصل لربك وانحر}<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 2/320</cite></blockquote><h3>他引述他人的说法</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعض المتأولين</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «إن المراد به ضع يدك على نحرك»<cite>«الصواعق المرسلة في الرد على الجهمية والمعطلة» 2/695</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">علي</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «إنه وضع اليمين على الشمال في الصلاة تحت صدره،»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 2/290</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=zh#s108a2\">在互动经注中打开（完整原文）</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/zh/ayah/108-3.html\">下一节 (108:3)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>两位谢赫经注汇编 · <a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">关于项目</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">隐私与条款</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/108-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>经注： Al-Kawthar 108:3 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"怨恨你者, 确是绝后的。\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"经注： Al-Kawthar 108:3 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"怨恨你者, 确是绝后的。\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"首页\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"章 Al-Kawthar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/surah/108.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"节 3\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/108-3.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> › <a href=\"/zh/surah/108.html\">章 Al-Kawthar</a> › 节 3</nav><h1>经注： 章 Al-Kawthar 108:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ الْأَبْتَرُ﴾</p><section><h3>意义翻译</h3><p class=\"tr\">怨恨你者, 确是绝后的。</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Chinese Translation - Muhammad Makeen — v1.0.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">两位伊玛目的话以阿拉伯语原文逐字呈现，并附出处。</p><section><h2>伊斯兰谢赫 伊本·泰米叶</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وفي قوله: {إن شانئك هو الأبتر} أنواع من التأكيد<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/533</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله {إن شانئك} أي مبغضك والأبتر المقطوع النسل الذي لا يولد له خير ولا عمل صالح فلا يتولد عنه خير ولا عمل صالح.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/528</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الثاني: الإتيان بضمير الفصل الدال على قوة الإسناد والاختصاص.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/533</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=zh#s108a3\">在互动经注中打开（完整原文）</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/zh/ayah/108-2.html\">上一节 (108:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>两位谢赫经注汇编 · <a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">关于项目</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">隐私与条款</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/108.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>经注： 章 Al-Kawthar — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"经注： 章 Al-Kawthar — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆论《古兰经》的意义\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://t